# Dependencies (root + nested MCP server)
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# NOTE: web_interface/static/mcp-server/ is the MCP installer's download
# source, served as a static asset. Vercel ignores buildCommand when a
# `builds` array is present, so `npm run build` does NOT run on deploy —
# the generated files must be committed. Run `npm run build` after editing
# anything under mcp-server/ and commit the result.

# Vercel + logs
.vercel
*.log
npm-debug.log*
